No response to input.	沒有任何回應。
We, at Sierra, wish to thank you for playing King's Quest. We are very sorry that you did not succeed and hope you will fare better next time. Good luck.	我們 Sierra 全體同仁感謝你遊玩《國王密令》。很遺憾你這次沒能成功，希望你下次能有更好的表現。祝你好運。
As you can no longer continue, I can only permit you to: Restore Game,  Restart Game or Take Inventory. Sorry.	由於你已無法繼續遊戲，目前只能執行：讀取進度、重新開始或查看物品欄。抱歉。
We, at Sierra, wish to thank you for playing King's Quest. We are pleased to see that you are doing so well and hope that your score will keep improving.	我們 Sierra 全體同仁感謝你遊玩《國王密令》。很高興看見你表現得如此出色，希望你的分數能持續進步。
We, at Sierra, wish to thank you for playing King's Quest. We are delighted by your score and hope you are enjoying the game.	我們 Sierra 全體同仁感謝你遊玩《國王密令》。你的分數令人欣喜，希望你樂在其中。
As you will never get out of this cage alive, I can only permit you to: Restore Game, Restart Game or Take Inventory. Sorry.	由於你不可能活著離開這座牢籠，目前只能執行：讀取進度、重新開始或查看物品欄。抱歉。
Unfortunately, with the moat population swimming is not possible.	很遺憾，護城河裡棲息著大量生物，沒辦法在此游泳。
You need to be in the water in order to swim.	你得先進到水裡才能游泳。
You are already swimming!	你已經在游泳了！
The swift current does not allow for swimming.	湍急的水流讓你沒辦法游泳。
It appears you have become normal size again.	看來你已經恢復成正常大小了。
You see nothing special.	你沒看見什麼特別的東西。
You cannot get the "%w2". At least not now!	你現在還拿不到「%w2」，至少現在不行！
There is no reason to do that.	沒有理由這麼做。
The "%w2" doesn't appeal just now.	「%w2」現在引不起你的興趣。
No. That would just waste time.	不行，那只會浪費時間。
You can try to go there.	你可以試著往那裡走。
That would be inappropriate at this time.	現在這麼做並不恰當。
Hello."	你好。」
OK. "%w2"	OK。「%w2」
You will have to find him yourself.	你得自己去找到他。
You will have to find her yourself.	你得自己去找到她。
You will have to find it yourself.	你得自己去找到它。
There is no "%w2" here.	這裡沒有「%w2」。
What do you wish to do with it???	你想拿它做什麼？？？
You can't eat the mushroom if you don't have it!	你身上沒有蘑菇，怎麼吃得到！
You can't do that--at least not now!	你沒辦法這麼做──至少現在不行！
Not right now!	現在不行！
There is nobody here but you!	這裡除了你沒有別人！
Just say what you wish to get.	直接說出你想拿的東西。
You get no response from the "%w2".	「%w2」沒有任何回應。
I don't understand "%w1".	我聽不懂「%w1」。
I don't understand "%w2".	我聽不懂「%w2」。
I don't understand "%w3".	我聽不懂「%w3」。
Fill what?	要裝滿什麼？
You have better things to do than to play all day.	你該做點正事，別成天只顧著玩。
What would you like to climb?	你想爬什麼？
Well.  Go look for it.	好吧，去找找看吧。
This is a very beautiful tree.	這是一棵非常美麗的樹。
This is just a normal tree, but very pretty.	這只是一棵普通的樹，但很漂亮。
You admire the beauty of the tree.	你欣賞著這棵樹的美。
This is a very nice looking rock.	這是一顆看起來很不錯的石頭。
There is nothing extraordinary about this rock.	這顆石頭沒什麼特別之處。
This is your ordinary rock.	這只是顆普通的石頭。
There is no "%w2" here to look at.	這裡沒有「%w2」可以看。
You do not have any water.	你身上沒有水。
There is no door here.	這裡沒有門。
The goat does not mind getting its feet wet,but will not swim in the water.  You should go back and lead the goat around the water.	山羊不介意弄濕腳，但牠不會游泳。你該回頭，帶著山羊繞過那片水域。
The goat, not being able to see you, wanders off.	山羊看不見你，於是四處遊蕩離去。
It is a mighty beanstalk that stretches to the sky.	這是一株雄偉的豆莖，直聳雲霄。
